:"requires-universal-lua-bridge","source":"doc/window.lua"},{"description":"Sets the dimming mode on a mobile device.\n\nThe dimming mode specifies whether or not a mobile device should dim the screen after a period without user interaction. The dimming mode will only affect the mobile device while the game is in focus on the device, but not when the game is running in the background.\n\nThis function has no effect on platforms that does not support dimming.\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/window-lua#window.set_dim_mode:mode)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:window.set_dim_mode","jsName":"setDimMode","line":128,"member":"set_dim_mode","modulePath":["window"],"overloads":[],"parameters":[{"description":"The mode for screen dimming","optional":false,"rawName":"mode","rawType":"window.DIMMING"}],"rawName":"window.set_dim_mode","returnDescriptions":[],"returns":[],"runtimeStatus":"requires-universal-lua-bridge","source":"doc/window.lua"},{"description":"Sets a window event listener. Only one window event listener can be set at a time.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```lua\nfunction window_callback(self, event, data)\n    if event == window.WINDOW_EVENT_FOCUS_LOST then\n        print(\"window.WINDOW_EVENT_FOCUS_LOST\")\n    elseif event == window.WINDOW_EVENT_FOCUS_GAINED then\n        print(\"window.WINDOW_EVENT_FOCUS_GAINED\")\n    elseif event == window.WINDOW_EVENT_ICONIFIED then\n        print(\"window.WINDOW_EVENT_ICONIFIED\")\n    elseif event == window.WINDOW_EVENT_DEICONIFIED then\n        print(\"window.WINDOW_EVENT_DEICONIFIED\")\n    elseif event == window.WINDOW_EVENT_RESIZED then\n        print(\"Window resized: \", data.width, data.height)\n    end\nend\n\nfunction init(self)\n    window.set_listener(window_callback)\nend\n```\n\n[Open in Browser](https://defold.com/ref/window-lua#window.set_listener:callback)","disposition":"generated-lua-bridge","generics":[],"id":"script:window.set_listener","jsName":"setListener","line"